        serverConfiguration = ServerConfiguration(baseUrl = FHIR_SERVER_BASE_URL)
      ),
      this,
    )
    // FhirEngineProvider only wires up its server DataSource as a side effect of the first
    // getInstance() call. Force that here so a sync triggered before any engine read/write
    // doesn't hit "ServerConfiguration is not set".
    FhirEngineProvider.getInstance(this)
  }
